        "message": "SHP-T-0.10: never evict a live cool-off to make room; blank TRUST_PROXY_HOPS means unset\n\nThe verifier showed that once 10,000 keys were tracked the throttle shed the oldest key,\nblocked or not, so a flood of junk keys from many addresses could clear an account's\nlockout and buy fresh guesses. Unblocked keys now go first. A blank TRUST_PROXY_HOPS\n(as .env.example ships it) parses as unset rather than 0.",
        "tree": {
          "sha": "476c3a92209a4c14af484682c5893eace19abe80",
